module gunbc.recurring_failure_mode.reference_query_answered_before_the_fact_is_earned

import std.types { NonEmptyStr }
import gunbc.recurring_failure_mode { RecurringFailureMode }

data reference_query_answered_before_the_fact_is_earned: RecurringFailureMode = RecurringFailureMode {
  identity: "reference_query_answered_before_the_fact_is_earned" as NonEmptyStr,

  receipts: [
    "**a `who references X` query is evaluated against an artifact produced at a stage that has not yet earned reference identity, so references the later stage would resolve are structurally invisible and their absence is returned as a zero** (INVALID STATE: a consumer asks a reverse-consumption question of a parse-stage artifact. ",

    "A bare reference survives parsing as an atom bearing its authored spelling, so it is found. ",

    "A QUALIFIED reference does not: name resolution rewrites the dotted path into a canonical atom carrying the resolved declaration's identity, and before that rewrite the path is a structure whose segments are not atoms at all. ",

    "So the query finds bare callers, misses qualified ones, and reports the difference as `nothing references X`. ",

    "MECHANISM, located: `v2.compiler.resolve` `try_resolve_qualified_name_node` returns `canonical_atom(identity: symbol_index_node_identity(...))` on a symbol-index hit, so the binding IS preserved -- but `v2.std.decl_index` `decl_facts` re-parses every source into a flat index and stops before resolution, so a lens folding `DeclFact.node` never sees it. ",

    "MEASURED (gunbc#10847 lane, fixture pool dag/test/fixture/effect_constructor_census as it then stood): a bare call rendered as one atom bearing the callee spelling; the qualified call to the same declaration rendered as five nodes with ZERO atoms and no named edges. ",

    "The authored source carried three occurrences of that name and the tree carried none, and the declaration was confirmed present in the pool, so file-absence was excluded as the cause. ",

    "THE INVERSION THAT MAKES THIS COSTLY TO SPOT: for this one question the SOURCE TEXT holds information the resolved-earlier artifact has dropped, so the ordinary instinct -- read structure, not text -- selects the weaker instrument and feels rigorous while doing it. ",

    "HARM: the zero is false in the one direction that authorizes destruction. ",

    "A deletion, a dead-code sweep, or a dangling-declaration refusal grounded on it removes a surface whose only callers were qualified, and every such zero is silently correct for bare-called surfaces, so the instrument looks accurate on most of its population. ",

    "THE CHEAP RECOGNITION RULE, and it is one question: name the STAGE that produced the artifact being queried, then ask whether the fact wanted is earned before or after that stage. ",

    "If it is earned after, every negative the artifact returns is uninformative and only its positives carry. ",

    "A SECOND SHAPE OF THE SAME ERROR, recorded because it is what actually drove the cost: the query was UNIVERSAL (`X has no consumer anywhere`) while the decision it served was EXISTENTIAL (`find one effect surface with a live consumer`). ",

    "An existential is discharged by one read call site; a universal requires semantically covering the candidate population. ",

    "Building the universal instrument to answer the existential question is what made a missing capability look like a blocker rather than an irrelevance. ",

    "RUNG FOUND AT: 1, mitigatable. ",

    "Nothing refuses a reverse-consumption query posed to a parse-stage artifact; the reader must know which stage earns the fact, so safety rests entirely on that occurring to someone. ",

    "CEILING: 3, structurally guaranteed. ",

    "Reference identity is earned by semantic resolution, so an artifact carrying reference facts can be typed to carry its own coverage -- which population was semantically processed -- and a query whose answer would exceed that coverage can be refused rather than answered. ",

    "It cannot reach 4: a partial population is a real state the model must represent rather than one it can make unwritable, exactly as a preempted claim's demand set is. ",

    "NEXT TRIGGER, NAMED AS THE CAPABILITY: **semantic forward-reference facts carrying an explicit coverage carrier, such that a reverse query over them REFUSES when the claimed universe exceeds the population actually resolved** -- sufficient for a consumer to distinguish `no reference exists` from `no reference was looked for`, demonstrated by a discriminating red on a fixture whose only caller lies outside the covered population. ",

    "Widening the parse index does NOT discharge it: no amount of parse-stage detail earns a fact the parse stage does not compute, and a positive-only reader over an already-compiled closure -- which IS sound -- discharges only the existential half.)",
  ],

  evidence: [],
}
